turnin A Damp, Dark Place
turnin Safeguarding the Watchers
turnin Saving the Sporeloks
turnin Balance Must Be Preserved
complete Plants of Zangarmarsh [optional] | 10 Unidentified Plant Parts drop from Zangarmarsh creatures as you quest.
turnin Plants of Zangarmarsh [optional] | Lauranna Thar'well; hand in whenever you are back with 10 parts.
turnin The Dying Balance
accept Thick Hydra Scales | Zurai, Swamprat Post.
accept No More Mushrooms! | Magasha.
accept Menacing Marshfangs | Reavij.
fp Swamprat Post
complete Thick Hydra Scales
complete No More Mushrooms!
complete Menacing Marshfangs
turnin Thick Hydra Scales
